  "changes": [
    "Removed explanatory comments; kept reference links and two behavior-critical notes.",
    "Shared public-key DER encoding through marshalPublicBytes.",
    "Checker tools use GO and OSSL overrides; the self-test runs trusted controls on the host.",
    "Plot script retains the published context figure only.",
    "Go module and commands moved to the root; checker, analysis, task specification and evidence grouped separately. Self-test copies only Go sources into each mutation workspace.",
