    "Public release contains structured measurements only. Raw model trajectories, responses and generated candidate sources remain private; analysis recomputes summaries from published named check outcomes and measured counts.",
    "Ported published-measurement validation and paired results analysis to Go. Removed the redundant Python release implementation; original raw-run auditing scripts remain in the manuscript workspace. The checker, signers, measurements and plot are unchanged. All summary fields agree with the Python implementation (maximum floating-point difference 1.12e-16); results.csv is byte-identical.",
    "Removed the stale call to the deleted state logger; self-test verdict accounting is unchanged.",
    "Clarified that the public source files are cleaned release copies, distinct from the frozen experimental sources."
